The time complexity of this solution is O(n), where n is the length of the input array. This is because we iterate through the array once, and each dictionary operation (lookup and insertion) takes constant time on average.

### Space Complexity

The space complexity of this solution is O(n), where n is the length of the input array. This is because we use a dictionary to store the numbers and their indices, which can have at most n entries.

